    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "He's a horrible human being. Look, I made a mistake. I voted for him in 2016 because I didn't pay enough attention to him. I felt at the time, like all his followers did, Our American politics is broken. We needed some disruption. Trump was a disruptor. It just turns out he's a horrible corrupt criminal human being. And I realized that pretty quickly after he got elected.",
