    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "I lost everything. And that's the deal. See, the Republican Party is a cult. all they care about. And I've been a Republican my whole life, but all they care about is Donald Trump. So if you are a Republican or a conservative in America and you publicly take on Trump, you're a dead man. You lose everything. And I did.",
