    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Oh, death threats every day. I mean, here's the deal. People ask me all the time, what does it mean to lose everything? And by the way, guys, this is why most Republicans don't say anything about Trump. They all feel the same way about Trump that I do. They know he's a dumb ass. They know he's a pathological liar. They know he's a horrible human being. They don't say anything because they don't want to lose everything. I mean, I lost my livelihood. I lost all of my followers, most of my friends. I have no chance of ever getting elected ever again as a Republican. That's what you give up in addition to all the threats.",
