  },
  {
    "episode_id": 88023,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "He's just a hell of a nice guy. I mean, this may be hard to understand, But for four years, we had a psychopath in the White House. I mean that. We had a psychopath. And so it's nice Joe Biden's just a nice old dude. He's just a nice normal guy who's just going about his business of being president. He's not in our grill. He's not in our face every day. He's not tweeting stupid crap every day. He's just doing his job and we hear from him every week or two. That's kind of refreshing.",
