  },
  {
    "episode_id": 88023,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "So can you actually think, and I know that Tim said this before, but was there a specific moment when the penny dropped for you where you went? I can't tolerate this anymore. I'm going to",
