        "text": "At the 2018 Helsinki summit, Donald Trump stated he believed Vladimir Putin over the U.S. intelligence community.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "After learning about Russian interference, Donald Trump prioritized protecting his victory over pursuing accountability.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "There were two moments.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers Trump’s statement at the Helsinki summit to constitute the greatest act of disloyalty by a U.S. president.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Russia attempted to influence the U.S. election in favor of Donald Trump.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Donald Trump obstructed investigations into Russian interference from the start.",
        "confidence": 0.93
