    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "You know, I don't like it. I mean, Facebook is free to do what they want. Twitter is free to do what they want. They're private companies. I wish they wouldn't abandon them though. I mean, I believe in free speech. I'm pretty much a free speech absolutist. I think unless you're just out and out lying or inciting violence, and I know Trump does that sometimes, I would rather they suspend him for a little bit, but not an outright ban.",
