    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Yes, they really believe it. Well, well, let me two groups of people. So Republican voters really believe it. I'm in a funny position, guys, because I'm still on the radio and I'm trying to be the only anti-Trump conservative on the radio. So I talk to thousands of Republican voters every day. They believe the big lie. They really do. Now, Republicans in Congress? No. Maybe just a few crazy Republicans do, but most every Republican in Congress knows it's BS. They know the election was installing, but they're cowards. They are literally cowards because they know their voters back home believe the lie. So they repeat the lie.",
