    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 34,
    "turn_text": "If we just go back to that your earlier comment saying that politics is broken in the United States, is that Republican politics or is there a side where the Democrats sort of side of the politics is also flawed?",
