    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "No, our whole system's broken. Look, this is why Trump won. And if Trump If Trump wouldn't have won back in 2016, I'll tell you what, if Bernie Sanders had been the Democratic nominee and not Hillary Clinton, because she was a horrible candidate, Bernie Sanders might have won. Bernie was a disruptor. Both political parties are broken. They've run the show for 168 years in this country. Most Americans feel like Washington DC doesn't listen to them and doesn't pay attention to them. And so really our whole political system is broken. And the other thing guys is, look, America is really divided. We've got 50 diverse states. I don't know. And I was saying this before Trump won in 2016. I don't know if America can stay united. This is the most divided this country has ever been and things could get really ugly in America.",
