    "turn_text": "We're speaking with Joe Walsh, former Illinois congressman, former presidential candidate speaking about that division. What role do people like Tucker Carlson and Sean Hannity play in that? And do they really believe, we're talking about what people really believe, but do they really believe the hatred and the fear that they're spreading?",
