    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/8/88023.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "Well, Hannity is an idiot, so Hannity might believe it. Tucker Carlson's a smart guy. So what he is doing guys is super, super, super dangerous. And all they do is they try to enhance the divide. Tucker Carlson and Sean Hannity and Rush Limbaugh when he was alive, and I've done conservative radio for a long time, it's all about getting your listeners and your viewers pissed off It's all about feeding their grievances and their resentments. And that's what Tucker Carlson and Hannity and the rest of them do. So they actually make the divide even worse.",
